---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Interactive Model" description="Multi-scale biotensegrity model exploring normal vs neurodivergent tension dynamics.">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
        Multi-Scale Biotensegrity Model
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 mb-6">
        Normal vs Neurodivergent Tension Dynamics
      </p>

      <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-teal-50 text-teal-800 text-sm font-medium rounded-full mb-10">
        Phase 1 Prototype in Active Development
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        This interactive model explores how tension and compression propagate through a simplified human biotensegrity network under two conditions: physiological baseline and chronic restriction within the eight sensor-rich zones.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Current Prototype Focus</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-lg text-slate-600 mb-12">
        <li>Systemic tensegrity network</li>
        <li>Suboccipital complex</li>
        <li>Visceral diaphragm</li>
        <li>Switchable Normal / Neurodivergent parameter sets</li>
        <li>Basic mechanoreceptor response mapping</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- Placeholder for future interactive embed -->
      <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center h-80 mb-12">
        <div class="text-center px-6">
          <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium mb-2">Interactive simulation coming soon</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Dynamic tension & compression visualization</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Current Progress</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Working Python prototype with force redistribution and receptor signal comparison.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Technical Approach</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Pure Python → future integration with NTRTsim / SOFA for higher-fidelity soft tissue.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Early Access</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Join the list to be notified when the interactive web version is available.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6">
        This is a research tool under active development. It is not a clinical diagnostic instrument.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
